@baseUrl = http://localhost:8084
@customerToken = paste-alice-token
@adminToken = paste-admin-token
@source = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@destination = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Register Alice (repeat with bob@example.test and admin@example.test before seeding)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"alice@example.test","password":"local-demo-password-123"}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"alice@example.test","password":"local-demo-password-123"}

### Create an unfunded account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName":"Emergency savings"}

### Balance is always read from PostgreSQL
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/{{source}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Cached profile (no balance)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/{{source}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Update profile; evict cache after commit
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/{{source}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName":"My savings"}

### Retry unchanged with this same key to receive the original receipt
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-transfer-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"sourceAccountId":"{{source}}","destinationAccountId":"{{destination}}","amount":125.50}

### History: inclusive from, exclusive to; adapt dates to your test data
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/{{source}}/transactions?page=0&size=20&sort=createdAt,desc&from=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-12-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Statement totals cover the entire range, entries are paginated
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/{{source}}/statement?from=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-12-01T00:00:00Z&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Admin accounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/accounts?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin ledger
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/transactions?size=20&sort=amount,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Run a completed UTC day's report
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reports/daily/2026-11-13/run
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### CSV export
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reports/daily/2026-11-13/csv
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
